<view class="checkin-page"><view class="checkin-head"><view class="kicker">CHECK-IN JOURNEY</view><view class="title">我的打卡</view><view class="head-row"><text>把走过的地方，变成自己的地图。</text><button bindtap="openRankings">看排行</button></view></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="state">正在读取足迹…</view><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="state">{{error}}<button bindtap="load">重试</button></view><view wx:elif="{{!list.length}}" class="state"><view class="mark">⌖</view><text>还没有打卡记录</text><text class="muted">从有效行程详情开始一次打卡吧。</text></view><view wx:else class="checkin-grid"><view wx:for="{{list}}" wx:key="checkinId" class="checkin-card" data-id="{{item.checkinId}}" bindtap="openDetail"><image src="{{item.imageUrls[0] || '/assets/covers/box1.jpg'}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="checkin-body"><view class="place">{{item.locationName}}</view><view class="note">{{item.note || '留下了一次旅途记录'}}</view><view class="meta">♡ {{item.likeCount}} · {{item.createdAt}}</view></view></view></view></view>
